  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Stock Availability**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how to define \"stock availability\" within the context of the gear rental system. I\'ve considered that the club\'s total equipment inventory can be stored in state. Now, I will think about how active rentals will impact the availability.\n\n\n**Calculating Active Rentals**\n\nI\'ve realized the rentals spreadsheet acts as a live log of equipment requests for each practice. I\'m focusing on summing requested items like paddles and life jackets from the records. I can add filters for searching by name and building a dynamic dashboard to display availability in real-time. This simplifies identifying items \"in use\".\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will create `/src/components/GearDashboard.tsx`. This component handles the visual inventory progress metrics (calculating remaining equipment count dynamically from spreadsheet records), search and filter utilities, and a clean card list displaying borrower details optimized for mobile reading."
