th section, since it\'s linked to the user\'s OAuth token.\n\n\n**Implementing Feature Controls**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the \"\345\225\237\347\224\250 AI \346\225\231\347\267\264\345\212\237\350\203\275\" toggle switch. If it\'s off, the \"\346\225\231\347\267\264\350\253\256\350\251\242\" tab hides, and `\'dashboard\'` becomes the default active tab. I\'m storing the state of `showAIConsultant` in `localStorage` to persist user preferences. If I can\'t find `showSettings`, I\'ll define it. I\'m also planning to save the toggle state in `localStorage` on change.\n\n\n"
